; partial-absence-honesty-band.fk — the partial-as-whole cousins answer
; honestly (2026-08-27): a recv that measured no byte for a REASON (dead
; handle, read error) answers the axiom-1 nothing, never the "" that let a
; truncated reply pass as complete; a slice of a file that never was answers
; nothing, matching read_file; and a directory listing GROWS past the old
; silent 512 wall instead of dropping the 513th entry — a partial listing
; wore a whole one's skin.
;
; PROOF LEVEL: FOURTH-ARM ONLY — these organs' heals live in the fkwu C seed;
; the Go arm's twin witness is TestPartialAsWholeOrgansAnswerNothing
; (form/form-kernel-go/hostexec_test.go), which also covers str_line_at
; past-end -> nothing (fkwu does not bind that name). Run:
;   ./fkwu form/form-stdlib/tests/partial-absence-honesty-band.fk
;
; The 600-file leg builds under form-stdlib/.cache (never /tmp — sibling
; agents collide there) and removes what it built.
;
; Bits (power-of-two weights):
;   1  socket_recv on a dead handle answers nothing
;   2  read_file_slice of a file that never was answers nothing
;   4  read_file_slice of real bytes answers them (first 4 of ground.fk)
;   8  a 600-entry directory lists all 600 (the 512 wall is down)
; witnessed: 2026-08-27 -> 15
(do
    (let a (socket_recv (sub 0 1) 16))
    (let c0 (if (nothing? a) 1 0))

    (let b (read_file_slice "/nonexistent-partial-absence-probe" 0 4))
    (let c1 (if (nothing? b) 2 0))

    (let c (read_file_slice "bootstrap/ground.fk" 0 4))
    (let c2 (if (nothing? c) 0 (if (eq (str_len c) 4) 4 0)))

    (let dir "form-stdlib/.cache/partial-absence-band-600")
    (let mk (host-exec (str_concat
        (str_concat "rm -rf " dir)
        (str_concat "; mkdir -p " (str_concat dir
        (str_concat " && cd " (str_concat dir
            " && seq 1 600 | xargs touch && echo ok"))))) ""))
    (let n (if (nothing? mk) 0 (if (eq (str_len mk) 0) 0 (len (fs_list dir)))))
    (let rmv (host-exec (str_concat "rm -rf " dir) ""))
    (let c3 (if (eq n 600) 8 0))

    (add c0 (add c1 (add c2 c3))))
